---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<section id="expertise" class="expertise-section">
        <div class="container">
            <h2 class="section-heading"><span>01.</span> Core Expertise</h2>
            <div class="expertise-grid">
                
                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <i class="fab fa-linux exp-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Linux Kernel Exploitation</h3>
                    <p>Primary focus on Ring 0 vulnerabilities, Local Privilege Escalation (LPE), kernel module analysis, and advanced memory/page table manipulation within custom Linux environments. </p>
                    <div class="exp-tags"><span>pwn</span><span>C</span><span>Kernel</span><span>GDB</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <i class="fab fa-android exp-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Android Security & RE</h3>
                    <p>Decompiling and reverse engineering applications. Proficient in dynamic instrumentation, analyzing Dalvik bytecode, hooking android applications and reverse engineering decompiled code.</p>
                    <div class="exp-tags"><span>Frida</span><span>Smali</span><span>Jadx</span><span>Gephi</span></div>
                </div>

                <div class="expertise-card">
                    <i class="fab fa-windows exp-icon"></i>
                    <h3>Windows Fundamentals</h3>
                    <p>Solid understanding of Windows user-space architecture and the PE file format. Experience with basic reverse engineering of Windows binaries and WinAPI analysis (focused entirely on user-land, pre-kernel level).</p>
                    <div class="exp-tags"><span>x64dbg</span><span>win32dbg</span><span>WinAPI</span></div>
                </div>

            </div>
        </div>
    </section>